{"4119580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashes of Paradise: Aetherion", "steam_appid": 4119580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of Paradise</strong> is an Open World Action Survival RPG featuring <strong>Co-op</strong> and <strong>PvP</strong>. Swap weapons in real time, shape-shift into animals to explore, unlock unique spirit mounts, and battle brutal bosses solo or with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Companion Spirits &amp; Unique Mounts:</strong> Discover ancient spirits to aid you in battle and unlock unique mounts to travel through Aetherion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦅 <strong>Animal Shapeshifting:</strong> Turn into a <strong>Crow</strong> to glide, a <strong>Stag</strong> to sprint, or a <strong>Cat</strong> to reach hidden areas. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/5070570151ce231b6a210a6c725797ec.poster.avif?t=1787241455\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/5070570151ce231b6a210a6c725797ec.webm?t=1787241455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/5070570151ce231b6a210a6c725797ec.mp4?t=1787241455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Dual Weapon-Swapping:</strong> Equip 2 weapons and swap instantly mid-combo to create unique builds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/b90278eefb3b1c07715f537aac1c5b25.poster.avif?t=1787241455\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/b90278eefb3b1c07715f537aac1c5b25.webm?t=1787241455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/b90278eefb3b1c07715f537aac1c5b25.mp4?t=1787241455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Co-op &amp; PvP:</strong> Raid dungeons and build bases with friends, or test your skills against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👹 <strong>Bosses &amp; Rifts:</strong> Face brutal monsters and conquer 5 corrupted dimensional rifts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/81658f1943f835ad674000a9375fb544.poster.avif?t=1787241455\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/81658f1943f835ad674000a9375fb544.webm?t=1787241455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/81658f1943f835ad674000a9375fb544.mp4?t=1787241455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚒️ <strong>Crafting &amp; Survival:</strong> Gather resources, craft gear, and unlock powerful classes and skills.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/d9ee670a6e89cfacaf37b28eb43cb5e5.poster.avif?t=1787241455\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/d9ee670a6e89cfacaf37b28eb43cb5e5.webm?t=1787241455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/d9ee670a6e89cfacaf37b28eb43cb5e5.mp4?t=1787241455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragrap